flowchart TD
    A[Dashboard Launch] --> B{Authenticated caregiver?}
    B -- No --> L[Login Page\nEmail + Password]
    L -->|Valid| O[Overview]
    L -->|Invalid| L

    B -- Yes --> O
    O --> U[Users / Linked Profiles]
    O --> R[Routines]
    O --> M[Medicines]
    O --> EC[Emergency Contacts]
    O --> SOS[SOS Alerts]
    O --> ACT[Activity & History]
    O --> PREF[Accessibility Preferences]

    U --> U1[User List - linked only]
    U1 --> U2[User Profile Detail]
    U2 --> U3[Create/Edit permitted details\nManage link - authorized]
    U2 --> PREF

    R --> R1[Routine List by User]
    R1 --> R2[Create/Edit/Delete Routine]
    R2 --> R3[Manage Steps\nAdd/Edit/Delete/Reorder]
    R3 --> R4[Assign to User]

    M --> M1[Medicine List]
    M1 --> M2[Add/Edit Medicine\ninstructions, dates]
    M2 --> M3[Configure Reminders/Frequency]
    M --> M4[Medicine History\nTaken/Skipped logs]

    EC --> EC1[Contacts List per User]
    EC1 --> EC2[Add/Edit/Delete Contact]
    EC2 --> EC3[Set Primary Contact]

    SOS --> SOS1[SOS Alert List\nreal-time/refresh from API]
    SOS1 --> SOS2[Alert Detail\nuser,time,location/map,delivery+alert status,contact]
    SOS2 --> SOS3[Acknowledge Alert\nrecords caregiver + time]

    ACT --> ACT1[Routine Completions]
    ACT --> ACT2[Medicine Logs]
    ACT --> ACT3[SOS Events]
    ACT --> ACT4[Filter/Sort Views]
